\":\"a9e9b31\",\"slug\":\"stateful-singing-dongarra\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01U5K6rLLR733xUbbS6xp41m\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"Todos have been modified successfully. Ensure that you continue to use the todo list to track your progress. Please proceed with the current tasks if applicable\"}]},\"uuid\":\"85948262-dd15-41de-aed6-df02a0dd6a1e\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-09T01:28:51.267Z\",\"sourceToolAssistantUUID\":\"27af042b-15db-4669-adc0-14f2c036a319\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"85948262-dd15-41de-aed6-df02a0dd6a1e\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"userType\":\"external\",\"cwd\":\"/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec\",\"sessionId\":\"4324a32c-1cc9-44af-9744-9ff1eb5152cc\",\"version\":\"2.1.45\",\"gitBranch\":\"feat/extract-session-path-resolution-v2\",\"agentId\":\"a9e9b31\",\"slug\":\"stateful-singing-dongarra\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-6\",\"id\":\"msg_014XW8bD2Ds9nNVcqhett369\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Here is a summary of all changes made across the four test files:\\n\\n---\\n\\n## File 1: `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec/tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts`\\n\\n**Added:** `let sessionsDir: string;` declaration and `sessionsDir = path.join(specDir, \\\"sessions\\\");` in `beforeEach`.\\n\\n**Replaced 40 occurrences** of `specDir` in session store function calls:\\n- `createSession(specDir, ...)` -> `createSession(sessionsDir, ...)` (10 calls)\\n- `appendEvent(specDir, ...)` -> `appendEvent(sessionsDir, ...)` (5 calls)\\n- `selectStaleActiveSessions(specDir, ...)` -> `selectStaleActiveSessions(sessionsDir, ...)` (8 calls)\\n- `getSessionEventsPath(specDir, ...)` -> `getSessionEventsPath(sessionsDir, ...)` (2 calls)\\n- `applyAutoAbandonMetadata(specDir, ...)` -> `applyAutoAbandonMetadata(sessionsDir, ...)` (5 calls)\\n- `getSession(specDir, ...)` -> `getSession(sessionsDir, ...)` (6 calls)\\n\\n**Not changed:** `specDir` in `fs.rm`, `fs.mkdtemp`, `execSync` (git operations) -- these are not session store functions.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## File 2: `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec/tests/cli/session-checkpoint-scoping.test.ts`\\n\\n**Added:** `let sessionsDir: string;` declaration and `sessionsDir = path.join(tempDir, 'sessions');` in `beforeEach`.\\n\\n**Replaced all occurrences:**\\n- `createSession(tempDir, ...)` -> `createSession(sessionsDir, ...)` (10 calls)\\n- `updateSessionStatus(tempDir, ...)` -> `updateSessionStatus(sessionsDir, ...)` (2 calls)\\n\\n**Not changed:** `tempDir` in `kspec(...)`, `setupTempFixtures()`, `initGitRepo(tempDir)`, `git(...)`, `cleanupTempDir(tempDir)`, `path.join(tempDir, 'sessions', ...)` in the raw fs operations (line 176-178) -- these are not session store function calls.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## File 3: `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec/tests/ralph/session-budget-integration.test.ts`\\n\\n**Three describe blocks updated:**\\n\\n1. **`ac-create-budget` block:** Added `let sessionsDir: string;` and `sessionsDir = path.join(specDir, \\\"sessions\\\");`. Replaced:\\n   - `createSessionWithBudget(specDir, ...)` -> `createSessionWithBudget(sessionsDir, ...)` (3 calls)\\n   - `getSessionBudgetPath(specDir, ...)` -> `getSessionBudgetPath(sessionsDir, ...)` (2 calls)\\n\\n2. **`ac-reset-iteration` block:** Added `let sessionsDir: string;` and `sessionsDir = path.join(specDir, \\\"sessions\\\");`. Replaced:\\n   - `createSessionWithBudget(specDir, ...)` -> `createSessionWithBudget(sessionsDir, ...)` (2 calls, including in `beforeEach`)\\n   - `incrementBudget(specDir, ...)` -> `incrementBudget(sessionsDir, ...)` (2 calls)\\n   - `getBudget(specDir, ...)` -> `getBudget(sessionsDir, ...)` (2 calls)\\n   - `resetBudget(specDir, ...)` -> `resetBudget(sessionsDir, ...)` (2 calls)\\n\\n3. **`ac-env-inject: budget enforcement` block:** Added `let sessionsDir: string;` and `sessionsDir = path.join(tempDir, \\\"sessions\\\");`. Replaced:\\n   - `createSessionWithBudget(tempDir, ...)` -> `createSessionWithBudget(sessionsDir, ...)` (2 calls)\\n   - `incrementBudget(tempDir, ...)` -> `incrementBudget(sessionsDir, ...)` (1 call)\\n\\n4. **`ac-env-inject: spawnAgent` block:** No changes -- does not call session store functions.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## File 4: `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec/tests/agent-invocation-lifecycle.test.ts`\\n\\n**Added `sessionsDir: path.join(testDir, \\\"sessions\\\"),`** to every `runInvocation({...})` options object (35 total calls across all describe blocks: AC-1 through AC-12, shadow commit tests).\\n\\n**Not changed:** `specDir: testDir` in `buildPromptWithSkills(...)` and `resolveSkills(...)` calls (AC-7 skill resolution tests) -- these are not session store functions and don't take a `sessionsDir` parameter.\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":1,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":279,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":100430,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":279,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"}},\"requestId\":\"req_011CYre2Ve3AGUbMjwXkZAhT\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"7ca69f07-405a-456b-b9e3-bd4cb6da558f\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-09T01:29:11.439Z\"}\n","prompt":"I'm working on the kynetic-spec project at /home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec. I need to update test files to pass `sessionsDir` instead of `specDir/testDir/tempDir` to session store functions.\n\nThe change: Session store functions in `src/sessions/store.ts` now accept `sessionsDir` (the actual sessions root directory) instead of `specDir` (from which they previously derived sessions path by appending `/sessions/`).\n\nFor tests, where `specDir`/`tempDir` was previously passed, we now need to pass `path.join(specDir, \"sessions\")` (or similar).\n\nPlease update these test files:\n\n1. **tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts** - Uses `specDir` variable. Add `const sessionsDir = path.join(specDir, \"sessions\");` and replace ALL session store function calls (createSession, appendEvent, selectStaleActiveSessions, getSession, applyAutoAbandonMetadata, closeSession, getSessionActivityForStaleCheck, evaluateStaleSession, etc.) that take `specDir` as first param with `sessionsDir`. Also check if applyAutoAbandonMetadata needs the `specDir` option for shadow commit.\n\n2. **tests/cli/session-checkpoint-scoping.test.ts** - Uses `tempDir`. Add `const sessionsDir = path.join(tempDir, \"sessions\");` and replace session function calls (createSession, updateSessionStatus, getSession, etc.) that pass `tempDir` with `sessionsDir`.\n\n3. **tests/ralph/session-budget-integration.test.ts** - Uses `specDir`. Add `const sessionsDir = path.join(specDir, \"sessions\");` and replace session function calls (createSessionWithBudget, resetBudget, getBudget, getSessionBudgetPath, etc.) that pass `specDir` with `sessionsDir`.\n\n4. **tests/agent-invocation-lifecycle.test.ts** - This test calls `runInvocation()` which takes `specDir`. Since `runInvocation` now derives `sessionsDir` internally as `path.join(path.dirname(specDir), \".kspec-sessions\")`, the tests need to either:\n   - Pass `sessionsDir` explicitly in the options, OR\n   - Set up sessions in the expected derived path\n   The simplest fix: pass `sessionsDir: path.join(testDir, \"sessions\")` alongside `specDir: testDir` in the `runInvocation` options. Read the test file to see how `testDir` is used and what the setup looks like. The test creates sessions at `testDir/sessions/{id}` already, so `sessionsDir: path.join(testDir, \"sessions\")` is the right value.\n\nFor EACH file:\n- Read the file first\n- Find where `specDir`/`tempDir`/`testDir` is defined\n- Add the sessionsDir variable right after\n- Replace all session store function calls\n- Make sure `path` is imported if not already\n- Do NOT touch non-session function calls\n\nUse the Edit tool to make changes. Be thorough — each file may have many call sites.","result":"{\"parentUuid\":null,\"isSidechain\":true,\"userType\":\"external\",\"cwd\":\"/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec\",\"sessionId\":\"4324a32c-1cc9-44af-9744-9ff1eb5152cc\",\"version\":\"2.1.45\",\"gitBranch\":\"feat/extract-session-path-resolution-v2\",\"agentId\":\"a9e9b31\",\"slug\":\"stateful-singing-dongarra\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"I'm working on the kynetic-spec project at /home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec. I need to update test files to pass `sessionsDir` instead of `specDir/testDir/tempDir` to session store functions.\\n\\nThe change: Session store functions in `src/sessions/store.ts` now accept `sessionsDir` (the actual sessions root directory) instead of `specDir` (from which they previously derived sessions path by appending `/sessions/`).\\n\\nFor tests, where `specDir`/`tempDir` was previously passed, we now need to pass `path.join(specDir, \\\"sessions\\\")` (or similar).\\n\\nPlease update these test files:\\n\\n1. **tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts** - Uses `specDir` variable. Add `const sessionsDir = path.join(specDir, \\\"sessions\\\");` and replace ALL session store function calls (createSession, appendEvent, selectStaleActiveSessions, getSession, applyAutoAbandonMetadata, closeSession, getSessionActivityForStaleCheck, evaluateStaleSession, etc.) that take `specDir` as first param with `sessionsDir`. Also check if applyAutoAbandonMetadata needs the `specDir` option for shadow commit.\\n\\n2. **tests/cli/session-checkpoint-scoping.test.ts** - Uses `tempDir`. Add `const sessionsDir = path.join(tempDir, \\\"sessions\\\");` and replace session function calls (createSession, updateSessionStatus, getSession, etc.) that pass `tempDir` with `sessionsDir`.\\n\\n3. **tests/ralph/session-budget-integration.test.ts** - Uses `specDir`. Add `const sessionsDir = path.join(specDir, \\\"sessions\\\");` and replace session function calls (createSessionWithBudget, resetBudget, getBudget, getSessionBudgetPath, etc.) that pass `specDir` with `sessionsDir`.\\n\\n4. **tests/agent-invocation-lifecycle.test.ts** - This test calls `runInvocation()` which takes `specDir`. Since `runInvocation` now derives `sessionsDir` internally as `path.join(path.dirname(specDir), \\\".kspec-sessions\\\")`, the tests need to either:\\n   - Pass `sessionsDir` explicitly in the options, OR\\n   - Set up sessions in the expected derived path\\n   The simplest fix: pass `sessionsDir: path.join(testDir, \\\"sessions\\\")` alongside `specDir: testDir` in the `runInvocation` options. Read the test file to see how `testDir` is used and what the setup looks like. The test creates sessions at `testDir/sessions/{id}` already, so `sessionsDir: path.join(testDir, \\\"sessions\\\")` is the right value.\\n\\nFor EACH file:\\n- Read the file first\\n- Find where `specDir`/`tempDir`/`testDir` is defined\\n- Add the sessionsDir variable right after\\n- Replace all session store function calls\\n- Make sure `path` is imported if not already\\n- Do NOT touch non-session function calls\\n\\nUse the Edit tool to make changes. Be thorough — each file may have many call sites.\"},\"uuid\":\"25110e83-8c40-4239-bb43-dc46e1a7ee42\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-09T01:24:01.486Z\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"25110e83-8c40-4239-bb43-dc46e1a7ee42\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"userType\":\"external\",\"cwd\":\"/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec\",\"sessionId\":\"4324a32c-1cc9-44af-9744-9ff1eb5152cc\",\"version\":\"2.1.45\",\"gitBranch\":\"feat/extract-session-path-resolution-v2\",\"agentId\":\"a9e9b31\",\"slug\":\"stateful-singing-dongarra\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-6\",\"id\":\"msg_01GveQbtjZ32b3YGpux4Sh1z\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\\n\\nI'll start by reading all four test files to understand their current structure.\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":3,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":10683,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":19600,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral